<title>USA: Conseco Inc Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Conseco Inc Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.49		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net			111,500		   46,300</p>
<p> Revs		   1,099,000		  691,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 203,600		  118,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 oper EPS $0.59, before $0.02/shr net investment loss, $0.08/shr extraordinary charge. Q1 1996 oper EPS $0.41, before $0.02/shr net investment loss, $0.15/shr restructuring income, $0.15/shr extraordinary charge.  </p>
<p>On primary basis, Q1 1997 EPS $0.49 (oper $0.59) vs Q1 1996 $0.42 (oper $0.44).</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
